' ===================== relationships =======================

Detection "1" *-- "1" Bbox
Detection "1" *-- "0..*" Keypoint
Alert "1" *-- "0..1" Person
Alert "1" *-- "0..1" DetectedObject
Alert "1" *-- "0..*" Keypoint
User "1" *-- "0..*" Session
Session "1" *-- "0..*" RefreshToken
AuditLogEntry "1" *-- "1" AuditPayload
Notification "1" *-- "0..1" TheftEventPayload
Notification "1" *-- "0..1" InfraAlertPayload
Notification "1" *-- "0..*" DeliveryAttempt
TheftEventPayload "1" *-- "0..1" Person
TheftEventPayload "1" *-- "0..1" DetectedObject
TheftEventPayload "1" *-- "0..*" Keypoint
DataSubject "1" *-- "1" SubjectReferences
DataSubject "1" *-- "0..*" ErasureStep
SubjectReferences "1" *-- "0..*" DeltaRowRef
AlertmanagerWebhook "1" *-- "1..*" AlertmanagerAlert

AuditPayload <|-- LoginSuccess
AuditPayload <|-- LoginFailure
AuditPayload <|-- LogoutEvent
AuditPayload <|-- DetectionWritten
AuditPayload <|-- AlertDispatched
AuditPayload <|-- AlertAcknowledged
AuditPayload <|-- ConfigChanged
AuditPayload <|-- AdminAction
AuditPayload <|-- DefenseRejected
AuditPayload <|-- DataSubjectErasure
AuditPayload <|-- ServiceLifecycleEvent

Detection "0..*" --> "0..1" Camera : at >
Alert "0..*" --> "0..1" Camera : at >
AlertResponse ..> Alert : projection of >
StatsResponse "1" *-- "0..*" TopObject
StatsResponse ..> Alert : aggregates >
Notification "0..*" --> "0..1" Alert : source >
Lockout "0..*" --> "0..1" User : attempted >
RefreshToken "0..1" --> "0..1" RefreshToken : succeededBy >
AuditLogEntry "1" --> "0..1" AuditLogEntry : chainedTo >

User ..> Role
AuditLogEntry ..> Severity
Notification ..> NotificationKind
Notification ..> TerminalState
DeliveryAttempt ..> Channel
DeliveryAttempt ..> DeliveryOutcome
DataSubject ..> CreatedReason
DataSubject ..> SuppressionMode
ErasureStep ..> ErasureStore

InfraAlertPayload ..> AlertmanagerWebhook : built from
Alert ..> SnapshotImage : snapshot_path
TheftEventPayload ..> SnapshotImage : snapshot_path
RefreshToken ..> RefreshTokenBlocklist : checked via
Lockout ..> LockoutCounter : live counter
SubjectReferences ..> Detection
SubjectReferences ..> Notification
SubjectReferences ..> AuditLogEntry
SubjectReferences ..> SnapshotImage

@enduml
